B.cma=s(["Veraxi combines FastAPI, Neo4j, Qdrant (MiniLM dense + SPLADE sparse vectors), Redis, SearXNG, and a cross-platform Flutter client. You can connect free cloud LLM providers (Gemini, Groq) or local models via Ollama.","Once `make up` completes, open FastAPI Swagger at http://localhost:8000/docs, Neo4j Browser at http://localhost:7474, Qdrant Dashboard at http://localhost:6333/dashboard, or SearXNG at http://localhost:8080."],t.s)
